[00:03.07]Staring down the edge of the cliff
[00:09.10]Pale blue is the water around me
[00:14.40]As I stare into eternity
[00:19.60]I see a figure in the distance
[00:23.11]Hair is flowing in the wind
[00:28.08]She slowly turns to face me
[00:33.45]I see lights
[00:36.14]And I
[00:38.43]Wake up
[00:39.10] 
[00:41.40]Imaginary girl
[00:43.48]An effervescent world
[00:45.28]Illuminating passages towards my broken heart
[00:49.26]A convoluted mind
[00:51.30]Interpolating lies
[00:53.36]To forget my memories of you
[00:55.30]I won't forget my memories of me and you
[00:58.24] 
